# Raw and split image data (keep folder structure via .gitkeep)
**/raw/**/*.jpg
**/raw/**/*.jpeg
**/raw/**/*.png
**/raw/**/*.webp
**/raw/**/*.bmp
**/labeled/**/*.jpg
**/labeled/**/*.jpeg
**/labeled/**/*.png
**/train/**/*.jpg
**/train/**/*.jpeg
**/train/**/*.png
**/valid/**/*.jpg
**/valid/**/*.jpeg
**/valid/**/*.png
**/yolo_export/images/**/*
!**/yolo_export/images/**/.gitkeep

